    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a boy on a ball and lead him to the end of the road without falling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only four keys are needed to play. Dodge obstacles, bounce, fly, run, and try not to fall in this 2D platform game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >01. Introduction<br>02. Kink<br>03. Bridge<br>04. Dangerous Corner<br>05. Ramp<br>06. Ramp Pass<br>07. Ramp Bridge<br>08. Thin Bridge<br>09. Twisty Bridge<br>10. First Bumper<br>11. Bumpers<br>12. Bumper Lane<br>13. Bumper Madness<br>14. Jump<br>15. Shotgun<br>16. Thin Bridge Jump<br>17. Tricky Jump<br>18. Gaps<br>19. Alef<br>20. Bet<br>21. Gimel<br>22. Dalet<br>23. Zayin<br>24. Chet<br>25. Yodh<br>26. Kaf<br>27. Samech<br>29. Spiral<br>30. Bonus: Beach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also create levels through a text editor. Modify the game and publish it in the community section!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a boy on a ball and lead him to the end of the road without falling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only four keys are needed to play. Dodge obstacles, bounce, fly, run, and try not to fall in this 2D platform game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >01. Introduction<br>02. Kink<br>03. Bridge<br>04. Dangerous Corner<br>05. Ramp<br>06. Ramp Pass<br>07. Ramp Bridge<br>08. Thin Bridge<br>09. Twisty Bridge<br>10. First Bumper<br>11. Bumpers<br>12. Bumper Lane<br>13. Bumper Madness<br>14. Jump<br>15. Shotgun<br>16. Thin Bridge Jump<br>17. Tricky Jump<br>18. Gaps<br>19. Alef<br>20. Bet<br>21. Gimel<br>22. Dalet<br>23. Zayin<br>24. Chet<br>25. Yodh<br>26. Kaf<br>27. Samech<br>29. Spiral<br>30. Bonus: Beach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also create levels through a text editor. Modify the game and publish it in the community section!</p>",
